# Keep internal files OUT of the public deployment (dvsl.vercel.app).
# Everything NOT listed here is still served normally (HTML, js/, assets/,
# config.js, manifest.json, sw.js, api/ functions, etc.).
#
# Why this exists: with no .vercelignore, Vercel served every file in the
# repo, including internal audits (one of which held the admin password),
# the captains' contact seed, stat spreadsheets, and setup notes. See the
# 2026-11 security pass.

# --- Agent / tooling dirs (never belong on the web) ---
.claude/
.github/

# --- Internal docs / notes ---
README.md
LEAGUE-SETUP.md
MORNING-REPORT.md
managers-welcome-letter.md

# --- Audit reports (current + any future ones) ---
*AUDIT*.md
AUDIT_2026-07.md
DATA_AUDIT_2026-05-06.md
SCHEDULE_AUDIT_2026-05-14.md

# --- Raw data exports (never fetched at runtime; data is baked into the pages) ---
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv

# --- One-off / seed node scripts (contain emails + phone numbers) ---
# None of these are browser modules; the site imports nothing with a .mjs
# extension. Seed + migration scripts only.
*.mjs
